Scoring system:
A+ means you have one of the best systems in place for fighting against RMT (Real Money Trading)
A means you have still a very good system just not the very best but you still have industry to near-industry standard protection
A- means you have a good system but it probably has some minor flaws that get exploited to bypass RMT banning 
B+ means you have a system comparable to old/kinda new roblox byfron when it still had flaws and was bypassed in a few weeks
B means you were on the right track for a good system but still have work to do and probably a ton of bug/bypass fixes 
B- means you probably have a ton of public bypasses and exploits for your RMT protection that people don't bother to hide since the software isn't that great
C+ to C- means you probably should reconsider a new protection system as this one won't help you that much if you have a gaint player base
F means you failed at either putting a protection system in or have such a terrible system a script kiddie can bypass it in hours

